[*]
[*] GTKWave save file for the randomised stress testbench (tb_stress_burst,
[*] DUT: axi4_to_apb4_2x_burst).
[*] Loaded automatically by:  make gtk  (default WAVETB=stress)  /  make gtk-stress
[*] Signals are organised into collapsible groups per AXI/APB channel plus the
[*] bridge's internal state.  Buses default to hex.  Regenerate the trace with
[*] `make wave-stress` (optionally STRESS_N=/STRESS_SEED=/... ) before viewing.
[*]
